    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Pakistan continues to experience a relatively low death rate from COVID-19 and a high proportion of mild or asymptomatic cases, contrary to the expectations of many experts. Professor Zahra Hasan and her team are working to understand why by examining the biology of both the virus and its human hosts.",
